Z||000000||Springtyme||09-24-2001||09:44 AM||||Okay, let me state right now that I don't mean to piss anyone off by this post, I just gotta get it off my chest.<P>I saw a sticker on the back of a Fiero (rather nice loookin one too, gave me good idea's of what to do to mine  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">) that said "No fat chicks, car will scrape" and it just pissed me off. I'm not the skinniest person in the world, but even if I was I would still take offense to that! It's so degrading! I've been made fun of for my weight before, but it doesn't really bother me. On the other hand, I also get honked at and yelled at when I walk down the street. I know it depends on the person's opinion, but that sticker is just wrong. ARGH I just don't know what to make of it<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Springtyme.jpg"> ||||reg||8
