Z||000002||Oreif||09-24-2001||10:22 AM||||In the United states everyone is allowed "freedom of speech" It's just some folks tend to use it to also show what an idiot they really are. There are many stickers/decals that are offensive to another race, religion, sex, car manufacturer, job, appearence, and just about anything else you can think of. Usually I just ignore them. You can put it off as a "consider the source" type of sign.<BR>||||reg||1
