Z||000009||Mach10||09-24-2001||11:39 AM||||Well, some are funny, others are just mean. My friend has a nasty pickup, on which he's got an assortment:<P>"Yes it's my truck, No, I'm not helping you move"<BR>"Free your mind, your ass will follow"<BR>"I just drive this way to piss you off"<BR>"Unless you are a hemmhroid, get off my ass"<P>He recently acquired one that said "Fat people are harder to kidnap" However, he put that one on for a few days, then took it off, because it was a bit too mean. <P>Thing is, though, there's definitely a "Consider the source" element here. Most of them aren't designed to really offend people, they are just funny to select people...||||reg||10
Z||000010||Springtyme||09-24-2001||11:56 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Spiff:<BR><B>I saw the same Fiero with the offensive sticker also. Was it at the POCI show on Sunday? It's just what the young kids think is cool now. Don't let it get you mad. I didn't get to meet you at the show , but hope to meet more people at more shows. Don't let this persons stupid sticker get you mad. By the way I had the White 88 Formula T-Top.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually, Spiff, I did meet you. You asked me if Snafus met up with us and I told you that I offered and he said he had to go out of town. Yes, it was that car at the show on sunday. Don't get me wrong, I like the car, but that was just.... *sigh* I dunno.<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroLisa:<BR><B>BTW was it a maroon GT?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yes it was, with a rather large wing on it, the wire casings on the engine painted blue along with many other things in the car, and the back PONTIAC light lit up green (or blue, I couldn't really tell. It looked like he used cellophane and just wrapped it around the lights to change the color.)<P>(Edited to add reply from Lisa)<p>[This message has been edited by Springtyme (edited 09-24-2001).]||||reg||1
