Z||000016||Monkeyman||09-24-2001||08:42 PM||||Don't let it bother you.  I'm too short for my weight, too.  (The right height for my weight is about 11 ft tall.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )  It used to bother me terribly, but now I usually just brush off any comments (just don't brush off any crumbs--especially not apple spice donut crumbs--MMMMM).  Hmm...What were we talking about?  Oh, right.  Weight.  Who cares if you're fat or skinny, tall or short, ugly or good looking (like me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ).  It's the inner beauty that really counts.  Just make fun of yourself.  It helps.  (i.e.  Weight lifters go for the '6 pack abs'.  I'm going for the 'kegger abs'.)  <P>Enough rambling.||||reg||1
